To use this function, you will need to include a markdown library in your project. There are many markdown libraries available, such as `libmarkdown` and `markdown-cpp`. You can download and include these libraries in your project using a build system like CMake.

Note: This function assumes that the markdown text is well-formed and does not contain any special characters that may affect the conversion process.

